      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARINER.\nAy, my lord, and fear\nWe have landed in ill time: the skies look grimly,\nAnd threaten present blusters. In my conscience,\nThe heavens with that we have in hand are angry,\nAnd frown upon ’s.",
