      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SHEPHERD.\nThat’s a good deed. If thou mayest discern by that which is left of him what he is, fetch me to th’ sight of him.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
